Third-party artwork
-------------------

The action icons adapt the following project marks to the Tanaab category
palette. Product names and marks belong to their respective owners; their use
identifies the tools these actions work with and does not imply endorsement.
Software and artwork licenses do not grant trademark rights.

- setup-node/icon.svg: Node.js JS mark, from
  https://nodejs.org/static/logos/jsIconGreen.svg
  Branding and trademark guidance: https://nodejs.org/en/about/branding
- setup-bun/icon.svg: Bun mascot linework, derived from
  https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/main/docs/logo/logo.svg
  Shading and blush removed; silhouette and facial details retained.
  The upstream license states "Bun itself is MIT-licensed":
  https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/main/LICENSE.md
- setup-openclaw/icon.svg: OpenClaw favicon silhouette, from
  https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/blob/main/ui/public/favicon.svg
  Animation and gradients removed. MIT notice reproduced below.
- npm-pack/icon.svg and publish-npm/icon.svg: npm wordmark, from
  https://github.com/npm/logos/blob/master/npm%20logo/npm-logo-black.svg
  Recolored; npm-pack adds a separate package symbol.
  Trademark guidance: https://www.npmjs.com/policies/trademark
- run-leia/icon.svg: planet portion of the Lando logo, from
  https://docs.lando.dev/images/logo.svg
  Isolated from the wordmark and recolored. MIT notice reproduced below.
- vitepress-build-check/icon.svg: VitePress logo paths, from
  https://vitepress.dev/vitepress-logo-large.svg
  Converted to flat outlines. MIT notice reproduced below.
- validate-codex-plugin/icon.svg and publish-codex-plugin/icon.svg: OpenAI
  mark from Simple Icons v14, recolored; publication adds a deprecated ribbon.
  https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons/blob/14.0.0/icons/openai.svg
  Brand guidance: https://openai.com/brand/
- publish-repo/icon.svg: Git mark from Simple Icons v14, recolored.
  https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons/blob/14.0.0/icons/git.svg
  Simple Icons paths are distributed under CC0 1.0 Universal:
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
  https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons/blob/14.0.0/LICENSE.md

The category circles, release tag/check, SSH terminal, package and publication
symbols, and publish-clawhub pincer drawing are covered by this repository's
MIT license. The pincer drawing is not an official ClawHub logo.

